    {
      "id": "claim_2eba9c8fcd78401c8abb24a354ab1bc0",
      "statement": "The four domains form a layered acyclic dependency graph: core depends only on the standard library; api depends on core plus fastapi/pydantic; sync depends on core only; cli depends on core and additionally on sync (for export/import delegation). sync never imports cli or api, and api never imports cli or sync.",
