    },
    {
      "id": "claim_45f165ab1d354e2387da143d954ef101",
      "statement": "get_store() lazily builds a module-level _store_singleton on first call and reuses it afterward; reset_store_singleton() clears it to None for test isolation. Tests currently override deps._store_singleton directly with a temp-dir Store. The singleton caches the Store object (its resolved path), not the bookmark data, so each request still does a full file read/write.",
      "evidence": [
